    "description": "Office Depot\nPen-Style Highlighters - Fluorescent Yellow\nLot of 6 Packs, 36 Highlighters Total\nThis bulk lot features thirty-six Office Depot brand pen-style highlighters, providing a substantial supply for office, classroom, or home use. These highlighters are engineered for sustainability, utilizing barrels constructed from 100% recycled plastic. The vibrant fluorescent yellow ink is formulated to be quick-drying and long-lasting, minimizing smudging and ensuring clear visibility for critical text across various paper types. Each pen features a pocket clip on the cap for easy transport and storage.\nVersatile chisel tip design permits both bold highlighting and precise fine underlining\nEco-conscious construction with 100% recycled plastic barrels\nLot includes six separate retail packs containing six highlighters each (36 total count)\nVerified Item 874-483 in original manufacturer packaging\nCondition:\nNew in original retail blister packs. All six units are factory-sealed and in excellent condition with no visible shelf wear or damage to the packaging. All ink is fresh and ready for immediate use.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
